final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_5vv68")
blurb = "Depicts Umibōzu (\"sea priest\"), a yōkai that appears to sailors on calm seas which quickly turn tumultuous. It demands a barrel from the sailors and proceeds to drown them. According to legend, the only safe way to escape an umibōzu is to give it a bottomless barrel and sail away while it is confused. It often appears as a humanoid shape with a shaved head and piercing eyes."
